      '<div class="bf">This is your sign-out. Not closed by ' + esc_(twelve_(mmText_(endM + NOCLOSE.GRACE))) + ', the register reads "' + NOCLOSE.LABEL + '" and Mr Rampersad is told.</div></div>' +
    hs.html +
